        </div>
        <div class="dev-details">
          <span class="dev-badge-role">IoT & Embedded Systems</span>
          <h3 class="dev-name">Pranjal Shahi</h3>
          <p class="dev-role">IoT Hardware Engineer & Developer</p>
          <p class="dev-bio">
            Engineered the ESP32 microcontroller firmware, analog sensor signal acquisition (MQ-135, pH probe, TDS), 
            hardware wiring circuits, cold chain temperature monitoring, and Wi-Fi HTTP telemetry integration.
          </p>
          <div class="dev-skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">ESP32 Firmware</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Embedded C/C++</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Circuit Design</span>
